{"text": "The New Home.\n\nLina is eleven. Today she has a new home.\n\nIt is an old building on a river. It has five floors. Lina and her mum live on floor four.\n\nLina runs up the steps. Every door has a number.\n\nOn the top floor, there is one door. It is blue. It has no number.\n\nLina tries the door. It does not open. It is locked.\n\nWho lives behind the blue door?\n\nMum carries boxes into the flat. Lina helps her.\n\nIn one box, there is a red pot. There is a flower in it. The flower is very dry. It is brown, not green.\n\n\"Poor flower,\" says Lina.\n\nShe puts it on her window. Mum looks at it.\n\n\"It needs sun,\" says Mum. \"And water.\"\n\nLina gives it water. But her window is small. There is not much sun here.\n\nIn the evening, Lina meets two neighbours.\n\nMr Tom lives on floor one. He has a big grey cat. Mrs Ada lives on floor two. She is old and small. She has a kind face.\n\n\"Who lives behind the blue door?\" asks Lina.\n\nMr Tom laughs. \"No one lives there. It is very old. No one has a key.\"\n\nMrs Ada smiles. \"No one lives there, dear. That is true.\"\n\nThen she goes into her flat.\n\nAt night, Lina can't sleep. Her new room is strange.\n\nIt is nine o'clock. The building is quiet and dark. Lina opens her door. She looks up the steps.\n\nThere is a light under the blue door!\n\nIt is a warm yellow light. Lina does not move. She waits and watches. At ten o'clock, the light goes off.\n\nIn the morning, Lina runs up again. There is something brown on the steps. It is in front of the blue door.\n\nLina touches it. It is earth.", "textSha256": "a07284b8f5d8a618236bad774a44d90c9d586b53e6a33af0086706275f21eb5b", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "H", "o", "m", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "L", "i", "n", "a", " ", "i", "s", " ", "e", "l", "e", "v", "e", "n", ".", " ", "T", "o", "d", "a", "y", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "